      "originalText": "Top Down View Ramp Jump\nCalculate horizontal ramp angle intervall\nGoal: Hit crane between pivot and boom end\n-> Evaluate angle between limiting curves (green area)\nRed: Launch origin / crane pivot || Green: Crane Boom + Weight \nOrange: flattest and steepest drive-up angle => defining tolerance\n",
